rchetype":"regular","unseen":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"月在幽冥，光自不息；大道之行，常隐于喧嚣之外。世人逐明而失真，惟在孤寂中可有所感。是夜风高月白，思古今之志士，多困而不屈。人生苦短,兼济独善，天道可知乎 \n大道隐幽暗，对月夜凭栏。知音今古何在，歌尽渺尘寰。眉敛千庭皓月，目送秋江万点，无语向\u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"like_count":5,"views":24,"category_id":1,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":3,"posters":[{"extras":null,"description":"原始发帖人","user":{"id":1,"username":"PalmPoetry","name":null,"avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/palmpoetry/{size}/7_2.png","admin":true,"moderator":true,"trust_level":4}},{"extras":null,"description":"最近的发帖人","user":{"id":3,"username":"海边2026","name":"Vivian Huang","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/海边2026/{size}/20_2.png","trust_level":1}},{"extras":"latest","description":"最新发帖人","user":{"id":4,"username":"Qinghongh","name":"user387","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/qinghongh/{size}/22_2.png","trust_level":1}}]},{"fancy_title":"七律   赤马红羊","id":24,"title":"七律   赤马红羊","slug":"topic","posts_count":4,"reply_count":1,"highest_post_number":4,"image_url":null,"created_at":"2026-08-23T23:27:46.688Z","last_posted_at":"2026-08-24T14:01:17.135Z","bumped":true,"bumped_at":"2026-08-24T14:01:17.135Z","archetype":"regular","unseen":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"七律   赤马红羊 \n作者/飞鸿 \n劫逢赤马望红羊，曾见开封北宋亡。 \n两代昏君荒国政，一朝横祸掳他乡。 \n民穷落草梁山泊，官恶贪财花石纲。 \n时运轮回今又是，谁能破解有良方？ \n注：靖康年（1126-1127）为赤马-红羊年","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"like_count":1,"views":12,"category_id":1,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":1,"posters":[{"extras":null,"description":"原始发帖人","user":{"id":4,"username":"Qinghongh","name":"user387","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/qinghongh/{size}/22_2.png","trust_level":1}},{"extras":null,"description":"最近的发帖人","user":{"id":1,"username":"PalmPoetry","name":null,"avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/pal